The issue is that TRAP and BATH belong to two different lexical sets in British English, but the same one in American English.  So I have no way of knowing which other similarly spelled words belong to which set in BrE.

Analagously, all nouns allow "the" before them in English, so I have no help determining which nouns take "el" and which take "la" in Spanish.

